# A throw in the play World's RenderList build: Play.Faulted, the editor
# alive, the World inspectable and drawn on the guarded path (M10a).
play
wait-ticks 60
inject-throw render
wait-frames 3
expect-faulted yes
expect-state faulted
expect-entities play 17
wait-frames 10
expect-faulted yes
stop
wait-frames 2
expect-state edit
expect-hash document initial
quit discard
